      "mergedPostDetails": "I was hoping yesterdays update would have fixed the problem caused by the one before. Now I’m worried that no one cares. Some of my avatars eye positions are not correct anymore (they are public avatars). Only I can see the problem. Other people see the eyes the way they are supposed to be. The problem is also only with quest. These avatars worked perfectly fine a couple of days ago. This DEEDS to fixed! Absolutely unacceptable! Made a similar post yesterday and the was asked for the avatar ID. I don’t know we’re to find that. All I know it the name of the world they are from. Justifire Rexouium Furry Avatars. PLEASE FOR THE LOVE OF GOD DO SOMETHING TO FIX THIS. My favorite avatars are in this world and you guys ruined them. That’s not right! You can’t just screw with the things people love and make no effort to make it right.",
